!Sample_organism_ch1 = Homo sapiens
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 9606
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = tissue: PBMCs
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell type: Primary B cells
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Total RNA extraction was performed using PureLink RNA mini kit (Ambion) and 1 ug of RNA as used. Ribosomal RNA was depleted using the NEBNext rRNA Depletion kit (human/mouse/rat) (New England Biosciences),NEBNext Ultra RNA Library Prep Kit for Illumina (Cat#E7530S) was used with 1 ug of total RNA for the construction of sequencing libraries.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA libraries were prepared for sequencing using NEBNext® Ultra RNA Library Prep Kit for Illumina protocols
!Sample_data_processing = The data was generated using standard protocol, describe in this paper,
!Sample_data_processing = http://www.nature.com/nprot/journal/v7/n3/abs/nprot.2012.016.html
!Sample_data_processing = 
!Sample_data_processing = The software used in mapping is Tophat, with default parameter, and transcription quantification is using Cufflinks, with default parameter.
!Sample_platform_id = GPL18573
